#!args --verify-dirty
# the wheel in the code editor (ui/code_edit.rs) on a long line: the horizontal wheel tilted
# right scrolls right, as Shift + the wheel turned down does (it scrolled left); a trackpad's
# pixels scroll sideways and back to the same place
size 1000 680
click tab:"Code"
cmd 904 100000
expect text:"lines: 1" exists
focus #3000
wheel #3000 0 120
shot build/editortest/code_wheel_right.png
wheel #3000 0 -120
wheel #3000 -120 shift
expect same build/editortest/code_wheel_right.png
wheel #3000 0 20 pixels
wheel #3000 0 -20 pixels
expect same build/editortest/code_wheel_right.png
